Package: omakub-devtools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash, jq
Recommends: bash-completion, imagemagick, python3, python3-pil
Conflicts: omadeb-devtools
Description: Development tooling for Omabuntu environments
 Provides the omakub-devtools command-line dispatcher and helper scripts used by
 developers working across Omabuntu: theme asset generation, preview formatting,
 and related build tooling. Not intended for end-user installation.

